   Ferrer-Urbina, Rodrigo; Mena-Chamorro, Patricio; Halty, Marcos; Sepulveda-Paez, Geraldy, Univ Tarapaca, Escuela Psicol \& Filosofia, Arica 1020000, Chile.},
DOI = {10.3390/ijerph19159293},
Article-Number = {9293},
EISSN = {1660-4601},
